---
// Thin bar above the tabs: sounding-server health, the new-address notice, and the current UTC time.
// Filled in by sounding-app.js.
---
<div class="spy-statusbar">
  <p class="spy-health" data-state="checking" role="status" aria-live="polite">
    <span class="spy-health-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="spy-health-text">Checking sounding server…</span>
  </p>
  <p class="spy-moved">We've moved! Update your bookmarks to <strong>sounderpy.app</strong></p>
  <p class="spy-clock"><time class="spy-utc"></time></p>
</div>
